{"seq":3,"slug":"domain-kg-practice","title":"领域知识图谱实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/knowledge-graphs/kg-applications/domain-kg-practice","wordCount":867,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"领域知识图谱实践\">领域知识图谱实践</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>领域知识图谱（Domain Knowledge Graph）是聚焦特定行业或领域的专业知识图谱，与通用知识图谱相比，它具有更深的领域知识覆盖、更精细的本体设计和更高的知识准确度。领域知识图谱是企业智能化的核心基础设施，广泛应用于医疗、金融、法律、电商等行业。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 领域知识图谱建设&#10;        NEED[需求分析] --&gt; ONTO_D[领域本体设计]&#10;        ONTO_D --&gt; DATA[数据源整合]&#10;        DATA --&gt; EXTRACT[知识抽取]&#10;        EXTRACT --&gt; QUALITY[质量保证]&#10;        QUALITY --&gt; SERVE_D[服务部署]&#10;        SERVE_D --&gt; MAINTAIN[持续维护]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 典型领域&#10;        MED[医疗健康]&#10;        FIN[金融风控]&#10;        ECOM[电商零售]&#10;        LAW[法律法规]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 领域知识图谱建设\n        NEED[需求分析] --&gt; ONTO_D[领域本体设计]\n        ONTO_D --&gt; DATA[数据源整合]\n        DATA --&gt; EXTRACT[知识抽取]\n        EXTRACT --&gt; QUALITY[质量保证]\n        QUALITY --&gt; SERVE_D[服务部署]\n        SERVE_D --&gt; MAINTAIN[持续维护]\n    end\n    subgraph 典型领域\n        MED[医疗健康]\n        FIN[金融风控]\n        ECOM[电商零售]\n        LAW[法律法规]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>领域</th>\n<th>核心实体</th>\n<th>核心关系</th>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>应用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>医疗</td>\n<td>疾病、药物、症状、基因</td>\n<td>治疗、副作用、适应症</td>\n<td>医学文献、临床数据</td>\n<td>辅助诊断、药物推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金融</td>\n<td>公司、人物、产品、事件</td>\n<td>控股、任职、担保</td>\n<td>公告、年报、新闻</td>\n<td>风控、投研</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电商</td>\n<td>商品、品牌、属性、用户</td>\n<td>属于、适配、替代</td>\n<td>商品信息、用户行为</td>\n<td>搜索、推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>法律</td>\n<td>法条、案例、当事人</td>\n<td>引用、适用、判决</td>\n<td>法律文书、判决书</td>\n<td>法律检索、智能审判</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"医疗知识图谱\">医疗知识图谱</h2><p>医疗知识图谱是领域 KG 中最成熟的方向之一。它整合了疾病、症状、药物、检查、基因等医学实体及其关系，为临床决策支持、药物研发和医学研究提供知识基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface MedicalKGSchema {&#10;  entityTypes: MedicalEntityType[];&#10;  relationTypes: MedicalRelationType[];&#10;  constraints: MedicalConstraint[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;type MedicalEntityType = &#39;Disease&#39; | &#39;Symptom&#39; | &#39;Drug&#39; | &#39;Treatment&#39; | &#39;Gene&#39; | &#39;Protein&#39; | &#39;LabTest&#39; | &#39;BodyPart&#39;;&#10;&#10;type MedicalRelationType =&#10;  &#39;has_symptom&#39; | &#39;treats&#39; | &#39;causes&#39; | &#39;interacts_with&#39; | &#39;contraindicated_for&#39; | &#39;targets&#39; | &#39;located_in&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface ClinicalDecisionSupport {&#10;  symptomChecker(symptoms: string[]): DiagnosisCandidate[];&#10;  drugInteractionCheck(drugs: string[]): Interaction[];&#10;  treatmentRecommendation(disease: string): Treatment[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface DiagnosisCandidate {&#10;  disease: string;&#10;  probability: number;&#10;  matchedSymptoms: string[];&#10;  suggestedTests: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;function symptomBasedDiagnosis(symptoms: string[], medicalKG: MedicalKG): DiagnosisCandidate[] {&#10;  const candidateDiseases = new Map&lt;string, { count: number; total: number }&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const symptom of symptoms) {&#10;    const diseases = medicalKG.getRelated(symptom, &#39;has_symptom&#39;, &#39;reverse&#39;);&#10;    for (const disease of diseases) {&#10;      const current = candidateDiseases.get(disease.id) ?? { count: 0, total: 0 };&#10;      current.count++;&#10;      current.total = medicalKG.getRelatedCount(disease.id, &#39;has_symptom&#39;);&#10;      candidateDiseases.set(disease.id, current);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return [...candidateDiseases.entries()]&#10;    .map(([diseaseId, stats]) =&gt; ({&#10;      disease: diseaseId,&#10;      probability: stats.count / Math.max(stats.total, symptoms.length),&#10;      matchedSymptoms: symptoms.filter((s) =&gt; medicalKG.hasRelation(diseaseId, &#39;has_symptom&#39;, s)),&#10;      suggestedTests: medicalKG.getRelated(diseaseId, &#39;diagnosed_by&#39;).map((t) =&gt; t.label),&#10;    }))&#10;    .sort((a, b) =&gt; b.probability - a.probability);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MedicalKGSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  entityTypes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MedicalEntityType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  relationTypes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MedicalRelationType</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  constraints</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MedicalConstraint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MedicalEntityType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Disease'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Symptom'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;-